# ============================================================
# Altraxon Labs — Contact Form (EmailJS)
#
# The site is a frontend-only Vite app deployed on Vercel. The contact form
# sends submissions straight to the Altraxon Labs inbox through EmailJS —
# no backend/server is required.
#
# Copy to `.env` for local development and/or set as Environment Variables
# on Vercel. Only the `VITE_` prefixed variables are exposed to the browser
# bundle by Vite. NEVER commit `.env`.
# ============================================================

# EmailJS Service ID (EmailJS dashboard → Email Services → your Gmail service)
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_emailjs_service_id

# EmailJS Template ID (EmailJS dashboard → Email Templates → your template)
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_emailjs_template_id

# EmailJS Public Key (EmailJS dashboard → Account → API Keys)
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The EmailJS template must be set up as follows (link the service first):
#
#   To Email:   altraxonlabs@gmail.com   (or the {{to_email}} variable)
#   Reply To:   {{reply_to}}              ← the visitor's email, so replies
#                                          from the inbox go to the visitor
#   From Name:  {{from_name}}
#   Subject:    {{subject}}
#   Content:    {{message}} plus any of these variables:
#               {{service}}  {{company}}  {{phone}}  {{budget}}  {{timeline}}
#
# Template Params (static by default — allowed because no sensitive data):
#   A "New Project Inquiry" email is sent to altraxonlabs@gmail.com with the
#   full form submission and the visitor's address as the Reply-To.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------